      "text": "word of the justice of the Eternal God, 1 Ne. 12:18. justice of God did also divide the wicked from the righteous, 1 Ne. 15:30. this thing must needs destroy … the mercy, and the justice of God, 2 Ne. 2:12. the greatness and the justice of our God, 2 Ne. 9:17. atonement satisfieth the demands of his justice, 2 Ne. 9:26. glorious day when justice shall be administered, 2 Ne. 9:46. justice cannot be denied, Jacob 6:10. demands of divine justice do awaken his immortal soul, Mosiah 2:38. standing betwixt them and justice, Mosiah 15:9. judgments of God are always just, Mosiah 29:12. cannot be redeemed according to God’s justice, Alma 12:18. requisite with the justice of God, Alma 41:3. justice of God in the punishment of the sinner, Alma 42:1. resurrection … according to the mercy, and the justice, 3 Ne. 26:5. no more return, because of the justice of the Father, 3 Ne. 27:17. doeth with you according to his justice and mercy, Morm. 6:22.",
